# pip/setuptools build output when rebuilding a procedures/*/vendor-src wheel
*.egg-info/
build/

# Model weights: classify-sentiment fetches these from the Hugging Face Hub
# at runtime (see procedures/classify-sentiment/src/handler.py) rather than
# bundling them -- GitHub rejects pushes of files this size without Git
# LFS, which this repo deliberately doesn't use. Guards against a local
# copy (e.g. from manual testing) getting committed by accident.
*.safetensors
